{
  "slug": "respira-for-wordpress",
  "name": "Respira For Wordpress",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Edit live WordPress sites from inside Claude Cowork. Tell\nClaude what you want changed and Respira routes the edit to\nthe right page builder, snapshots before writing, and validates\nthat the page actually rendered correctly. Twelve page builders\nsupported (Elementor, Divi 4, Divi 5, Bricks, Oxygen, Breakdance,\nBeaver Builder, WPBakery, Flatsome, Brizy, Thrive Architect,\nGutenberg). One-click rollback always available. No FTP. No\ndatabase access. No REST plumbing.\n\nBuilt for the agency owners, designers, and freelancers who\nmanage WordPress sites for clients and want to delegate the\nediting work to Claude without giving up control.\n\nBundled: eight slash commands for the most common workflows,\nthirty auto-activating skills (including sixteen builder-to-\nbuilder migration paths), and one visual reviewer sub-agent\nthat opens the live page after every edit so you can see what\nchanged.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **41 skills**, **1 agent**, **8 commands** and **1 MCP server**.\n\n- **Skills** (41): `activity-report-composer` (Turn the audit log of work done on a WordPress site into a polished written report), `brand-voice-synthesizer`, `build-oxygen6-page`, `content-portability` (Export WordPress pages, posts, and custom posts to portable local packages with builder data, media, and human-readable markdown), `conversion-audit` (Audit a WordPress site for conversion-rate friction across six dimensions: above-the-fold clarity, CTA hierarchy, form length, social proof…), `custom-post-type-architect` (Design and create WordPress custom post types end to end — CPT + supporting taxonomies + ACF field…), `design-system-synthesizer`, `figma-to-elementor`, and 33 more\n- **Agents** (1): `visual-reviewer` (After any Respira write, opens the live URL and gives a best effort visual confirmation that the change…)\n- **Commands** (8): `add-section` (Add a new section to an existing WordPress page), `audit-site` (Run an accessibility, SEO, or performance check on a connected WordPress site), `connect-site` (Connect a WordPress site to Respira through Cowork), `duplicate-page` (Duplicate a page so you can edit safely without affecting the live version), `edit-page` (Edit a page on a connected WordPress site), `help` (Show the available Respira commands and how to use them), `preview-changes` (See what is currently on a page in your browser, before or after an edit), `undo-last-change` (Roll back the most recent edit on a connected WordPress site)\n- **MCP servers** (1): `respira-wordpress`\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install respira-for-wordpress@claude-community` from `respira-press/cowork-plugin-wordpress`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
